WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
<b>Towano Chikai-sensei Signing</b>

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.730
What rapturous applause.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:16.100
I need to burn Onii-chan's 
grand performance onto my retinas.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:53.050
Episode 4: I Just Wanted to Catch Up to My Little Sister, That's All

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.130
It's really entertaining!

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.640
Thank you for your kind words.

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:53.630
I hope you continue to enjoy my work.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.880
That's the last of them.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:00.760
Thanks for coming here today.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:04.390
I'm really glad the book signing went so well.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.130
Thanks for all of your support, too.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.170
Thank you very much.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.400
<i>Huh? Where did those three go?</i>

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:18.030
<i>Mai lined up at 4am so she'd get in first, 
 and demanded 30 signatures.</i>

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:23.530
<i>Double Peace-sensei made me sign
 a shikishi board with a lewd sketch on it.</i>

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:28.460
<i>And Suzuka was keeping an eye on the event 
in a seriously suspicious outfit.</i>

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:33.000
I guess I'll go look for Shinozaki-san for now.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:37.180
W-Wait!

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.200
Ow...

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:40.630
Hey, are you all right?

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.520
S-Sorry.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:44.420
Huh?

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:47.650
I-Is it over already?

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:50.320
You mean the signing?

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.840
It just ended.

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:57.150
Are you a fan who came 
down here for the signing?

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.880
No, not at all.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.840
I'm not just a "fan."

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:01.660
Huh?

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:05.200
I'm not just a "fan." 
I'm a super-duper mega-fan!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.950
It was my very first signing 
and I won the drawing for it, too.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.550
I can't believe I missed it 
because work dragged on and on.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:11.770
U-Um...

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:13.320
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:15.610
Here I am, complaining 
to a complete stranger!

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:18.420
Please, don't worry about me. 
And thanks for your help.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:22.430
I'll be all right. Keeping 
my chin up is what I'm best at.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.840
Anyway, there's not much I can do if it's over.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.930
I'll just have to wait for another signing.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.800
Ah... Please, wait a minute!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.540
Let me go check with the staff.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.780
Sorry for the wait.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:40.120
Did you bring a copy for me to sign?

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.740
H-Huh? What's going on?

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:45.340
Oh, sorry, I forgot to mention...

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.120
I'm Towano Chikai.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:48.020
Huh?

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.370
Huh?!

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:57.100
U-Um, a-are you really, 
uh, Towano-sensei?!

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.480
Uh, yes. Anyway...

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.710
N-No way!

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.360
I-I'm s-s-sorry!

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:05.390
I'm just so overwhelmed by all this!

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.300
Um, could you sign this please?

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:09.920
Thank you very much.

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.890
Oh, who should I make it out to?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:17.300
Oh, r-right. I haven't 
introduced myself yet.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:21.400
Let me do so now. 
I'm Minazuki Sakura.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.240
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:27.030
Mi-na-zu-ki Sa-ku-ra-san... Huh?

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:32.420
Y-You don't mean Minazuki Sakura
 the voice actress, do you?!

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:35.290
Yes! That's exactly who Sakura is!

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:40.120
<i>Minazuki Sakura's new to voice acting,
 but landed a main heroine as her first role.</i>

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:44.800
<i>She's a rising star who's voicing the main 
character in this season's breakout anime!</i>

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:46.130
Um, Sensei?

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:48.320
Huh? Oh, I-I'm sorry.

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.810
I'm just surprised a voice 
actress is a fan of mine.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:54.810
You have lots of fans 
in the industry, Sensei!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:59.820
If your series ever becomes an anime,
 I won't let anyone else take the lead role!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:02.440
Y-You're really passionate 
about this, aren't you?

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:03.730
Of course I am!

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:07.160
I love, love, <i>love</i> those siblings to death!

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.010
They're my ideal sibling pairing!

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:13.040
Ah, if only my <i>real</i> brother 
was like your character.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:13.700
Huh?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.250
Oh, no, forget I said anything.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:22.020
The point is, I fell in love with 
your little sister character.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:27.470
Lately, I've been losing myself in your series 
so much, I start thinking I <i>am</i> Yuuka-chan.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.220
Y-You get that into it?

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:33.530
So would you mind if 
I called you "Onii-chan," Sensei?

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:34.730
Why would you do that?!

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:37.230
Please, Onii-chan?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.560
<i>Wait, wasn't I in middle school when
 Minazuki Sakura made her debut</i>

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:44.340
<i>as a high school voice actress?</i>

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.240
<i>What the... She's calling me "Onii-chan,"</i>

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.990
<i>but doesn't that make her older than me?</i>

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.990
What are you thinking, Onii-chan?

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:58.660
Thank you very much for today.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.290
If it ever gets animated, 
I'll land the little sister's role,

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:04.740
so keep your fingers crossed 
for me, okay, Onii-chan?

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.950
She was rather attractive, wasn't she?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.100
S-Suzuka?!

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:16.910
She's got a big rack, too. 
Just how you like 'em, Onii-chan.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.350
Is that how it is?

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:24.030
Do women need to have big boobs to grab 
your attention? Do they? Must they be...

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:27.240
I-I need to go meet up with Shinozaki-san.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:28.850
You're right.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:34.070
I should probably avoid meeting 
Shinozaki-san face-to-face,

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:36.680
so I'll go buy some books I want 
while you're doing that.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:37.700
Yuu!

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.440
It's finally over, huh?

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:42.920
Huh? Double Peace-sensei isn't with you?

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.670
She got a work call, 
so she went home.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.930
I hope she wasn't skipping out
 on work to be here.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:55.260
Yeah. Yes. I'll expect to hear 
from you about it later.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.250
Well, well, if it isn't Enryuu-sensei.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:06:59.310
What are you doing here?

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:04.500
I'm Yuu's number one fan, 
so of course I'd be at his signing.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.570
Um, you looked pretty busy,
 Shinozaki-san...

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.670
Nah, it's nothing I can't handle.

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:13.450
We're just hashing a few things out 
concerning the media mix for your title.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:16.330
Media mix? You mean, an anime?

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:19.080
Sorry, but I can't tell you anything right now.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:22.850
When your editor says that, 
it means it's practically a done deal.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.330
S-Seriously?

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.020
Excuse me.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:29.340
Yes, Shinozaki speaking.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:29.930
Yes.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:31.270
Yes.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.050
Huh? That won't do at all!

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:37.430
We're getting nowhere over 
the phone, so I'll head back.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.630
There's been a hiccup.

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.810
I'm sorry, but I'm going to 
have to take my leave now.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.690
You really do seem busy.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:49.580
I plan on making sure that 
this title goes down in history.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:52.710
And I'm prepared to do anything 
to make that happen. Bye.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.560
Thank you very much.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:58.640
My editing department?

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.340
Yes, it's me.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:02.570
Yes.

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:04.460
Huh? That's...

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.490
No, I understand.

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:10.800
So, right now?

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:16.240
Sorry, my editors have 
called an emergency meeting.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:17.510
Huh? Really?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:21.320
Jeez. And I planned to invite 
you out for a bite to eat, too...

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:22.060
Damn.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.650
Well, see you at school tomorrow.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.180
Yeah, see you later.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.650
I'm beat.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:35.240
<i>I only have some polishing up 
to do, so guess I'll head home.</i>

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:36.780
Morning, Yuu.

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:40.200
Why are you leaping out of your skin?

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.580
Oh, no. No reason.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.440
I don't get you—

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.960
Wait, what's that?

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:46.950
Huh?

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:47.830
Is that...

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.710
A manuscript?

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:49.970
N-No!

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:51.290
This is, um...

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:54.090
...reference material for world history!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.720
O-Oh, that reminds me. 
You were late today, weren't you?

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.620
Hm? Yeah, I guess.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:04.730
Oh, more importantly, 
come with me for a bit.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.320
H-Hey, wait!

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.760
It's almost time for class!

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:09.150
Who gives a crap about class?

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.240
You can't just play hooky!

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.370
Just come with me!

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.370
Hey!

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.420
So what is it?

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:22.490
Yuu. Tell me how you made
 your writing so entertaining!

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:23.330
Huh?

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:28.500
Hold up. I thought you'd been 
stalking me to try and figure that out.

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:33.300
Of course! I've got lots of info 
from the research I've done so far.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:37.730
But unfortunately, I haven't managed 
to figure out your secret yet.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:42.490
So I realized that I should
 just probe you directly!

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:44.200
Ask all you want, but...

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:52.520
Hey, Yuu! We're not done talking!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.530
Class is starting!

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.310
You should head back to class soon, too!

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:01.780
Believe me, I <i>will </i>uncover your secret.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:08.540
Huh?

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.720
Hey, what happened to Himuro-san?

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:12.260
Huh?

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.300
She said she wasn't feeling well, so she left.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.920
Sh-She couldn't be...

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:24.600
Wh-What do you think you're doing?!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.000
Hey, what <i>is</i> this?

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.230
You didn't write this, did you?

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.640
W-Well... it's...

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:36.740
My friend's writing a light novel 
and he asked me to read it.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.440
I see.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:41.070
No wonder the writing's so bad.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.960
It's not the least bit entertaining,

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:45.300
the composition has an oddly affected tone,

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:48.710
and, well, its biggest problem 
is its lifeless characters.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:53.000
But I've seen this style somewhere before...

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:57.930
This is <i>exactly</i> the same as the manuscripts 
in the wastepaper basket in your room.

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:59.470
Yeah, there's no doubt about it.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:03.100
W-Wait... You went through my trash? When?

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:06.630
Huh? When I came over 
and hung out in your room.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:08.960
Don't say that like it's perfectly natural!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:11.600
Forget that. What's going on here?

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.360
W-Well...

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:14.930
Hey, Yuu...

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:17.970
Are you really Towano Chikai?

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.950
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer</b>

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:26.250
First, let's review what's going on.

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:29.960
Onii-chan, please explain it 
to me in detail one more time.

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.460
O-Okay.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:35.570
I took my own manuscript 
to school and Mai saw it,

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:38.590
but the style was completely 
different from Towano Chikai's,

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.720
so she's suspicious now.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:45.470
For starters, you've been letting your 
guard down around Himuro-san, Onii-chan.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.470
Th-That wasn't my intention...

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:50.950
No. Speaking objectively, it's a fact.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:54.740
She's already near you a lot 
 because she's your classmate,

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:57.480
and she takes every chance 
she gets to buddy up to you.

00:11:57.990 --> 00:12:01.070
And here <i>I</i> am, wishing I could 
spend all my time with you, too...

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:02.360
You wish what?

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.950
Huh? N-No, nothing.

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:11.920
Still, doubting your identity just because 
the style was different is a big leap.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:16.040
Still, once the seed of doubt is planted, 
 it won't go away easily.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:19.250
So no matter how much 
you argue with her,

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.300
it's unlikely Himuro-san 
will accept your explanations.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:24.050
R-Right.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:28.530
However, if you follow the 
stratagem I'm about to outline,

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.180
I believe we can dispel her doubts.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.030
A stratagem?

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:33.660
Well...

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:37.560
Suzuka?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:41.070
Please start flirting with me!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.800
"F-Flirting"?!

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.070
What do you mean, flirt with you?!

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.840
P-Please calm down!

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:48.940
Listen. I'm about to explain.

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:52.540
P-Paying attention?

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.930
Considering my title 
is about a little sister,

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:59.190
we just have to show her 
that the author is someone

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:01.840
who absolutely adores little sisters,

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:04.840
<i>especially</i> his own little sister.

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:08.880
S-So you need to convince Himuro-san 
that Towano Chikai is a man

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.710
who simply loves his little sister to death!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:15.890
Do that, and I'm positive you'll dispel 
any doubts in Himuro-san's mind!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.270
Makes sense.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:21.360
But even if it's just an act, are you
 okay with me flirting with you?

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.820
I-It won't be a problem...

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.260
Well, all right!

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.570
Let's go show her how flirty we are!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.240
Th-That's my Onii-chan all right!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.470
That's the spirit!

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:34.580
Let's seize this chance and
 do lots and lots of flirting!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.080
Y-Yeah!

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:37.720
From here on out, we'll call this

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:43.260
"Operation: It's Obvious an Author Who Writes
Little Sister Stories Loves His Little Sister!"

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.870
Our first mission is...

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:50.220
<i>Our mission is a date?</i>

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:56.190
<i>Does she really think no one can see her?</i>

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.080
Onii-chan!

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:00.940
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.990
Oh, I only just came out here myself.

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.710
Looks like Himuro-san's here.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:12.270
I think pretending we haven't 
noticed her is gonna be the hard part.

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:13.590
Well, whatever.

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:15.620
Our aim is to put on a display for her, anyway.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:19.910
N-Now, shall we kick off 
our date already, Onii-chan?

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:24.310
Man, I'm so happy you said yes
to going on a date with me, Suzuka.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:29.000
G-G-Going on a date with you 
is like a dream come true!

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:32.010
I wondered where he was off to. 
He's on a date with his little sister?

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.470
I already knew Yuu had 
the hots for his little sister,

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:37.640
but is he planning to lay his 
dirty hands on Suzuka-san?

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:41.060
Nagami Yuu is more 
beastly than I imagined.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.770
He's willing to sacrifice 
his own sister for his work—

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:46.650
<i>She's so loud. And what
 </i>does<i> she think she's writing?</i>

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.750
<i>Still, our stratagem seem to be working.</i>

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:56.120
L-Ladies' underwear?

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:57.570
Y-Yes...

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:00.160
I'll explain, so you don't get the wrong idea.

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:03.880
I came up with this idea 
after thinking about our goal.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.530
If we want her to see us flirting,

